    <briefdescription>
<para>Bimap for the GPU rendering backend selection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Maps integer keys to the three valid gpu config values: 0 → &quot;auto&quot; — GPU if available, CPU fallback (default) 1 → &quot;true&quot; — Force GPU rendering 2 → &quot;false&quot; — Force CPU rendering</para>
<para>Registered in <ref refid="classend_1_1_application" kindref="compound">Application</ref> CONTEXT before <ref refid="classconfig_1_1_model" kindref="compound">config::Model</ref> construction. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
